{"id":31044,"date":"2022-10-11T15:27:00","date_gmt":"2022-10-11T14:27:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/?p=31044"},"modified":"2023-05-17T10:55:00","modified_gmt":"2023-05-17T09:55:00","slug":"excel-vba-training-for-beginners","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-vba-training-for-beginners\/","title":{"rendered":"Excel VBA Training For Beginners"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Visual Basic for Applications (VBA) is a powerful programming language that allows you to control Excel using code. With VBA, you can automate tedious and time-consuming tasks, perform complex calculations with ease, optimise your code to improve performance, and much more.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you&#8217;re new to programming or simply want to learn how to use Excel VBA, this guide is for you.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Basics of Excel VBA Programming<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Keen to learn VBA programming? At The Excel Experts, we offer both individual and group training courses for every level of Excel user, from beginner to expert.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our VBA programming course for beginners covers all the essential topics you need to know to get started with programming in Excel. You&#8217;ll learn how to write your own macros, customise Excel&#8217;s User Interface (UI), and automate common tasks using code.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you&#8217;re already familiar with programming in another language, our Advanced VBA course will show you how to take your skills to the next level and write code that is more robust, efficient, and scalable.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Excel-VBA-Basics.jpg\" alt=\"Excel VBA Basics\" class=\"wp-image-31050\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Excel-VBA-Basics.jpg 700w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Excel-VBA-Basics-300x214.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What You&#8217;ll Learn: Excel VBA Basics<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With Excel VBA, users can automate tedious tasks which would otherwise take too long or require more resources.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is beneficial for a whole host of users, from those who work with large data sets on a daily basis to those who simply want to make their lives a little bit easier by learning some basic VBA programming for smaller tasks.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this guide, we&#8217;ll cover all the basics of Excel VBA programming, from understanding the syntax and writing your first macro to more complex topics like working with objects and collections, debugging code, and best practices.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Keen To Start?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Complete our simple enquiry form below and a member of our team will be in touch.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-contact-form-7-contact-form-selector\">\n<div class=\"wpcf7 no-js\" id=\"wpcf7-f26780-o1\" lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\" data-wpcf7-id=\"26780\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"><p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"><\/p> <ul><\/ul><\/div>\n<form action=\"\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/31044#wpcf7-f26780-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form init\" aria-label=\"Contact form\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<fieldset class=\"hidden-fields-container\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"26780\" \/><input type=\"hidden\"